# Still frames of the temporal upscale (graphics plan 1г, reports/render-features/2026-11-05-upscale): perf-shot's
# market and interior views. A view gets a still after ten seconds of a camera that stands (`<view>`); then a cut
# starts the history over at the same spot, and stills follow as it fills again (`<view>-cut-<ms>`).
# `ui on` routes each shot through the swapchain-sized frame, so a reduced resolution is upscaled.
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
overlay off
ui on
view full
cam lift off
goto NW_CITY_MERCHANT_TRADE_04
freeze PAL_203_LOTHAR
watch player
cam look 120
cam world 700 280 90
wait 10000
cam hold
shot market
wait 500
cam cut
cam world 700 280 90
wait 34
cam hold
shot market-cut-0
wait 100
shot market-cut-100
wait 400
shot market-cut-500
wait 1500
shot market-cut-2000
wait 500
set time 22 0
goto pos 3924 -73 -6663
watch player
cam look 110
cam world 160 170 0
wait 10000
cam hold
shot interior
wait 500
cam cut
cam world 160 170 0
wait 34
cam hold
shot interior-cut-0
wait 100
shot interior-cut-100
wait 400
shot interior-cut-500
wait 1500
shot interior-cut-2000
wait 500
